			"Message": "docs(Sky): Redraw architecture diagram to reflect actual component layout\n\nThe previous Mermaid graph used flat generic labels (`Pages`, `Workbenches`, `WorkbenchImpl`) that did not correspond to the real source tree structure or runtime data flow. Reorganize into nested subgraphs matching the actual `pages/` and `Workbench/` directory hierarchy, add the `Function/Sky/Bridge.ts` (`SkyBridge`) event channel layer, and rewrite all edges to show the true routing path from env-driven variant selector through page entry points to workbench implementations.\n\nClarify the Wind subgraph as the in-process service layer with explicit references to `Preload.ts` and the 40+ service `TauriLiveLayer`. Rename the external dependency box from generic `External` to the published `@codeeditorland/output` package. Correct the Tauri/Mountain IPC flow to show bidirectional `sky://` event emission and `tauri::invoke` command dispatch.\n\nThis makes the diagram a faithful reference for contributors navigating Sky's component graph.",
			"SHA": "78873e2a472dae40858a628e25f0d5023d7dd931"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-05-19T02:51:33Z",
			"File": [
